hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"323","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko nahin janta ke Aap ne kisi din ka roza us ki fazeelat ko dinon par talash karte hue rakha ho siwae is din ke, yani yom Aashura."
"324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas yom Aashura ka zikr hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh ek din tha jise Jahiliyat wale roza rakhte the; to tum mein se jo chahe use roza rakhe, aur jo na-pasand kare woh use chhor de.'"
"325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Aashura ka roza rakhte aur ham ko us ke roze ka hukm dete."
"326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar main aainda saal tak salamat raha to main nawin [tarikh] ka zaroor roza rakhunga.'"
"327","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan ko yom Aashura Madinah ke mimbar par suna; unhon ne apni aasteen se balon ka guchha [masnui baal] nikala aur kaha: Ai Madinah walo, tumhare ulama kahan hain? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aisi cheez se mana farmate suna. Aur farmaya: 'Banu Israil halak hue jab un ki aurton ne ise [masnui baalon ko] apnaya.' Phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is din farmate suna: 'Beshak main rozedar hun; jo chahe roza rakhe.'"
"328","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yom Aashura ek din tha jise Quraish Jahiliyat mein roza rakhte the; aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jahiliyat mein use roza rakhte. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae to Aap ne use roza rakha aur us ke roze ka hukm diya. Phir jab Ramadan farz hua to woh farz raha aur yom Aashura chhor diya gaya; jo chahe use roza rakhe aur jo chahe chhor de."
"329","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan ko yom Aashura un ke hajj wale saal mein suna, jabke woh mimbar par the, kehte hue: Ai Madinah walo, tumhare ulama kahan hain?! Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Beshak yeh din yom Aashura hai; Allah ne tum par us ka roza nahin likha. Aur main rozedar hun; jo chahe roza rakhe aur jo chahe iftar kare.'"
"330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nawan aur daswan [Muharram] ka roza rakho; aur Yahud se mushabahat na karo."
